** MMM9000 - NATURAL MAP REGRESSION FIXTURE (issue 4.4)
** Map body recognition is best-effort against documented T/F tagged-line
** conventions, unverified against a real client export -- see the
** map_body_unverified gap this member raises on ingest.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #ORDER-NO (A10)
1 #ORDER-STATUS (A4)
END-DEFINE
*
1 T 'Order number:' 01/01
1 F #ORDER-NO (AD=I) 01/16
1 T 'Status:' 02/01
1 F #ORDER-STATUS (EM=XXXX,AD=I) 02/16
END
